        "id": 1259838
      },
      "writtenOn": "2018-12-11T21:38:25Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The code implies that there will be a different set of doorbell registers for each ipc_peer (implied by the .in_drbl_rg and .out_drbl_reg).\n\nIf there isn\u0027t another set of doorbell register for the ISH, then we should remove these fields from the configuration struct and use IPC_HOST2ISH_DOORBELL and IPC_ISH2HOST_DOORBELL directly.",
      "parentUuid": "bf42d57b_b645e061",
