      "writtenOn": "2018-12-11T21:38:25Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Since this MNG task here and the defines at the top are pretty self contained, let\u0027s pull them out now in their own separate file.\n\nThis should just be named ipc.c right. There is nothing really specific about HECI in here (expect the occasional encoding/decoding scheme like MGT)",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 658,
        "startChar": 3,
        "endLine": 658,
